      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-balls/#wprm-recipe-54255-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Keto-Sausage-Balls-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the oven for about 35 minutes or until internal temperature reaches 165F.",
